before the New Year.

00:01:15.274 --> 00:01:16.408
-Yes. Oh, yes.

00:01:16.475 --> 00:01:18.244
-Saw you at a party.
-Fancy party.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:20.246
-Real fancy party.
-Very showbiz.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.882
-Yeah, a lot of A-listers.
-Lot of A-listers.

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.751
-And then us. Yes.
-Yeah, we were there too.

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:26.252
-Yeah.
They kept saying,

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.855
