00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:33.493
-Yes.
-Um, but you also, I heard --

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.228
Just do you think
it's in preparation

00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:36.729
to maybe coming back
to 30 Rock

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:39.365
where you work, that you had
a you had an anxiety dream.

00:01:39.431 --> 00:01:41.667
-Okay, so I knew
when I, you know,

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:42.901
I knew I was coming back
to see you.

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:44.704
And then that night,
I had a dream

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.506
that you and I
were getting married.

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:50.276
Okay. And -- And, like,
it was just very awkward

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:52.611
because we hadn't talked
about it at all.

00:01:52.678 --> 00:01:54.847
And like, I was like,
are we going to text each other

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:56.315
about this or like.

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:58.384
And then we were supposed
to get married that night and --

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:00.687
and I was just I was
feeling awkward about it.

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:03.990
