00:02:24.042 --> 00:02:25.878
I would love if Lorne had
an anxiety dream about me.

00:02:25.944 --> 00:02:27.280
That would be amazing.

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:28.648
-If Lorne woke up
and just turned over,

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:29.849
