"I had the worst night.

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:31.517
I had a dream.
Rachel was mad at me."

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:33.352
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:34.587
-I would love it. Please.

00:02:34.653 --> 00:02:36.155
-Um, uh,
you have a new podcast?

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:37.423
-Yes.
-"Woo Woo."

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.124
-Okay. Yeah.
"Woo Woo with Rachel Dratch."

00:02:39.191 --> 00:02:40.593
Now that's me.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.327
Sorry, I didn't have to say
the name, but anyways.

00:02:42.394 --> 00:02:43.696
But "Woo Woo" is -- Okay.

00:02:43.762 --> 00:02:46.866
So over the years
I have collected like I love

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.501
when you're gathered
with friends

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:50.536
