like super into crystals,

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:31.144
but she could veer
into the crystals.

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:32.845
-Probably not going
to make the article.

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:34.013
-Okay.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.314
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:37.717
-Amy's wind crystals.
Okay. By the way.

00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:40.119
