00:03:45.124 --> 00:03:46.492
but I'd love to come on.
-Right.

00:03:46.558 --> 00:03:47.860
-And then I had to --
You didn't write me back.

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:49.395
-Okay, that's true, but...

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:51.597
-And so a week later, I was
like, well, now I have a story

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:53.332
